{"ID":"20230926153348-p3sajxh","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926153348-p3sajxh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926153348-p3sajxh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926153353-c6hz5t3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926153353-dn10e2k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926153353-dn10e2k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:44,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:44\u0026#125;","title":"【白术茯苓半夏枳实汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926153353"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926153353-c6hz5t3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926153353-c6hz5t3","updated":"20230926153353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：白术三两、茯苓四两、半夏一升、枳实一两半"}]},{"ID":"20230926153353-nul2hf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926153353-nul2hf3","updated":"20230926153353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右四味，以水六升，煮取三升，去滓，分温三服。"}]},{"ID":"20230926153353-dn10e2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926153353-dn10e2k","updated":"20230926153353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【12.5】先吐后利，腹中满痛，无寒热，脉濡弱而涩者，此宿食也。白术茯苓半夏枳实汤主之。"}]}]}